{"id":"5fa77b46620e79c3","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-equivalence-class.md","title":"ZFC Equivalence Class","display":"df-zfc-equivalence-class — ZFC Equivalence Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-equivalence-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-equivalence-class","58-df-zfc-order7-equivalence-class","58-df-zfc-rel-equivalence-class"],"display":"df-zfc-equivalence-class — ZFC Equivalence Class","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-class]]","[[../batch03/58-df-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-equivalence-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-equivalence-class</span><span>58-df-zfc-order7-equivalence-class</span><span>58-df-zfc-rel-equivalence-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-equivalence-class — ZFC Equivalence Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1a891abf5fe2909c\" href=\"?note=1a891abf5fe2909c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-equivalence\">../batch03/58-df-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X\">\\(A,X\\)</span> (base sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (equivalence relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1a891abf5fe2909c\" href=\"?note=1a891abf5fe2909c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-equivalence\">../batch03/58-df-equivalence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span> (representative)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> (equivalence-class set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}\\)</span> (equivalence-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1a891abf5fe2909c\" href=\"?note=1a891abf5fe2909c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-equivalence\">../batch03/58-df-equivalence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{field}\">\\(\\operatorname{field}\\)</span> (field of a binary relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7EquivalenceClass}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7EquivalenceClass}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClass}_S\\)</span> (alias predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S(C,x,R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,A)\\land x\\in A\\land C=\\{y\\in A:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S(C,x,R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,A)\\land x\\in A\\land C=\\{y\\in A:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class\\text{-}order7} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7EquivalenceClass}_S(X,R,x,C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,X)\\land x\\in X\\land C=\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class\\text{-}order7} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7EquivalenceClass}_S(X,R,x,C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,X)\\land x\\in X\\land C=\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class\\text{-}rel} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClass}_S(C,x,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,\\operatorname{field}(R))\\land x\\in\\operatorname{field}(R)\\land C=\\{y\\in\\operatorname{field}(R):\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class\\text{-}rel} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClass}_S(C,x,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,\\operatorname{field}(R))\\land x\\in\\operatorname{field}(R)\\land C=\\{y\\in\\operatorname{field}(R):\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-order7-equivalence-class</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-rel-equivalence-class</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1a891abf5fe2909c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1a891abf5fe2909c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R$ (equivalence relation, see [[../batch03/58-df-equivalence]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1a891abf5fe2909c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}$ (equivalence-relation predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-equivalence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,X","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{field}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7EquivalenceClass}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S(C,x,R,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,A)\\land x\\in A\\land C=\\{y\\in A:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class\\text{-}order7} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder7EquivalenceClass}_S(X,R,x,C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,X)\\land x\\in X\\land C=\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class\\text{-}rel} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClass}_S(C,x,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,\\operatorname{field}(R))\\land x\\in\\operatorname{field}(R)\\land C=\\{y\\in\\operatorname{field}(R):\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1731,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1866","locations":["正文"],"count